  "en": {
   "stanzas": [
    [
     "Thoughts are free,",
     "Who can guess them?",
     "They fly past",
     "Like shadows of the night.",
     "No person can know them,",
     "No hunter shoot them.",
     "So it remains:",
     "Thoughts are free."
    ],
    [
     "I think what I will",
     "And what makes me happy,",
     "But all in quiet",
     "And as is fitting.",
     "My wish and desire",
     "No one can forbid.",
     "So it remains:",
     "Thoughts are free."
    ],
    [
     "Even if they lock me up",
     "In a dark dungeon,",
     "Those are still only",
     "Futile works;",
     "For my thoughts",
     "Tear the barriers",
     "And walls in two:",
     "Thoughts are free."
    ],
    [
     "Now I will for ever",
     "Renounce love",
     "And will no longer",
     "Torment myself so with fancies.",
     "One can, after all, in one's heart",
     "Always laugh and joke",
     "And think meanwhile:",
     "Thoughts are free."
    ],
    [
     "I love wine,",
     "My girl above all,",
     "She alone",
     "Pleases me best.",
     "I am not alone",
     "With my glass of wine,",
     "My girl beside me:",
     "Thoughts are free."
    ]
   ],
